{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">ChS8 is a passenger, two-section, eight-axle electric locomotive operating on 25 kV 50 Hz AC. It was manufactured by \u0160koda in 1983, 1987, and 1989 for the Soviet railways, with a total of 82 units produced.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It is one of the most powerful passenger electric locomotives used in Russia and Ukraine (former USSR). As of 2017, most of these locomotives remained in regular operation.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3609220?t=1743005857","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3609220?t=1743005857","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609220/4fe7f0471aa3589f8f73116b835304a3a483e913/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743005857","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609220/4fe7f0471aa3589f8f73116b835304a3a483e913/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743005857","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">ChS8 is a passenger, two-section, eight-axle electric locomotive operating on 25 kV 50 Hz AC. It was manufactured by \u0160koda in 1983, 1987, and 1989 for the Soviet railways, with a total of 82 units produced.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It is one of the most powerful passenger electric locomotives used in Russia and Ukraine (former USSR). As of 2017, most of these locomotives remained in regular operation.</p>","developers":["ZDSimulator Team"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3381120","name":"ZDSimulator"},"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609220/90e9cc72b9a38e2609cb6e9cea25cb2634c86376/header.jpg?t=1743005857","is_free":false,"linux_requiremen